      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The East Branch of the Rahway River borders Vauxhall, and a 1831 gristmill by Lewis Pierson dammed the river.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
